 <h3><u>Dastoor juda jaana</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=Apple-style-span arial,= sans-serif;= line-height:= normal;= border-collapse:= collapse;= color:= rgb(34,= 34,= 34);= =></span></p>
  <div>
   Hai Ishk E Mohammad (S.a.w.w.) Ka Dastoor Juda Jaana.....2
   <br>Jeene Ki Alamat Hai Sarkar Pe Mar Jaana
   <br>
   <br>Hai Ishk E Mohammad (S.a.w.w.) Ka Dastoor Juda Jaana
   <br>
   <br>Tai Kar Ke Yeh Nikla Hai Ghar Se Koi Deewana.....2
   <br>Is Baar Madine Se Wapas Hi Nahi Aana
   <br>
   <br>Jibril Se Bhi Aage Pohuche Hai Shab E Asrar.....2
   <br>Kaam Aagaya Zarron Ka Kadmon Se Lipat Jaana
   <br>
   <br>Jaa Poch Le Adam (A.s.) Se Mitti Hai Kharab Uski.....2
   <br>Jis Ne Bhi Mohammad (S.a.w.w.) Ko Apna Sa Bashar Jana
   <br>
   <br>Salman Ka Shaida Hun Behlol Ka Aashik Hun.....2
   <br>Kehti Hai Mujhe Dunia Deewano Ka Deewana
   <br>
   <br>Har Roz Hi Hoti Hai Aaqa Ki Sana Akbar.....2
   <br>Har Roz Hi Hota Hai Jannat Me Mera Jaana
   <br>
   <br>Hai Ish E Mohammad (A.a.w.w.) Dastoor Juda Jaana.....
